1
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,600
This is a week's worth of cat food I prepared for him.

2
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,930
I prepared an extra box.

3
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:25,040
I'll put it in the fridge when I leave.

4
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,240
Make sure to heat it up when you feed him.

5
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,600
Two scoops of cat food at noon is enough.

6
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,100
When he plays at night,

7
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,119
you can give him some cat treats.

8
00:00:32,119 --> 00:00:33,050
But not too much.

9
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:35,880
Jinzi,

10
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:38,540
be a good boy for your cousin after Mommy leaves.

11
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,160
Jinzi.

12
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,360
Is Camera A ready?

13
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,240
Is Camera B ready?

14
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:11,200
OK, get ready.

15
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:11,880
Three.

16
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:17,400
Hello, viewers.

17
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:20,160
Welcome to 'An Unexpected Life'.

18
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:21,920
I am your host, Liu Ding.

19
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,400
Today,

20
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,000
many new friends

21
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:27,360
have entered 'An Unexpected Life'.

22
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:30,720
Our two old friends, Yaoyao and Yueyue,

23
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,320
are already familiar to everyone.

24
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:35,720
Then please have our new friends introduce themselves.

25
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,640
Hello, everyone.

26
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,479
I'm Su Fan.

27
00:01:38,479 --> 00:01:40,800
It's a pleasure to be on 'An Unexpected Life.'

28
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:41,440
Hello, everyone.

29
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,960
I'm actor Luo Li.

30
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:43,920
Su Fan and I

31
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:46,450
just finished a historical political drama.

32
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,960
This drama combines

33
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:51,400
politics, suspense, detective work, action, and more.

34
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,240
He plays a young assassin.

35
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:55,720
I play a princess from an enemy state.

36
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:56,479
Yes.

37
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:57,680
I play

38
00:01:57,680 --> 00:02:01,080
a down-and-out scholar who falls in love with his enemy's daughter.

39
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,080
Can we spoil that?

40
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,200
Let's let everyone guess

41
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,720
if this will be a tragic romance.

42
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,280
Let's leave some suspense, okay?

43
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,740
Please look forward to it.

44
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:10,060
I'm really looking forward to it.

45
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,000
Hello, everyone.

46
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,480
We are the core team of 'A Chinese Ghost Story.'

47
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,000
I

48
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:16,880
am Bai Feixin.

49
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,960
In 'A Chinese Ghost Story,'

50
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,720
I play Nie Xiaoqian.

51
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,079
This is Jin Xi.

52
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:24,240
In our 'A Chinese Ghost Story' musical,

53
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,000
he plays Ning Caichen,

54
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,720
who is also my love interest.

55
00:02:30,079 --> 00:02:30,560
Hello, everyone.

56
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,480
This is our greatest director,

57
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,680
Director Ning Jin.

58
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:36,840
I hope everyone pays attention to our troupe

59
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,680
and 'A Chinese Ghost Story.'

60
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,360
Yes.

61
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,480
As far as I know,

62
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:43,200
Jin Xi doesn't have a musical theater background.

63
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,840
So everyone wants to know,

64
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,760
how did you get involved in this?

65
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:49,680
I didn't know much about musicals before,

66
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,720
but the first musical I saw

67
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,650
was our director's original work.

68
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:56,480
So I made up my mind then

69
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,410
that I must work with the director.

70
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:01,600
The musical you're talking about is 'Jian Jia.'

71
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:02,080
Yes.

72
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:06,050
The female lead is Feixin, sitting right next to you.

73
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:06,600
Yes.

74
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,960
So I didn't expect

75
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,880
Jin Xi and I to be so destined to work together.

76
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:10,160
I...

77
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,360
Speaking of destiny,

78
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:13,640
this is also Su Fan and my second time working together.

79
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:13,920
Yes.

80
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:14,960
Our first work

81
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,000
was a modern drama,

82
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,880
and this time we are collaborating on a historical drama.

83
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:20,560
Not only is this our second collaboration,

84
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:23,160
but we're also very good friends in private.

85
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:25,440
Are you as good friends as Jin Xi and I?

86
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,480
Because we perform stage plays,

87
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:29,320
we rehearse together day and night.

88
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,720
Stage plays also require spending day and night together.

89
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:31,200
Right.

90
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:33,480
We film historical dramas for over ten hours a day.

91
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:34,720
It's super hard work.

92
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,079
We don't even have a personal life.

93
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:36,760
Wow.

94
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,800
Then you must know each other very well.

95
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,120
But do you usually...

96
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:40,980
Guys, let's...

97
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,970
Wait, let's pause for a second.

98
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,130
Mr. Liu Ding.

99
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,880
The fishing scene is ready.

100
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:46,600
Okay.

101
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:47,680
Everyone, take a break.

102
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,880
We'll continue at another scene later.

103
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:51,960
Good job, everyone.

104
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,960
Let's go prepare for the next scene.

105
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:10,200
Um.

106
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,650
We are missing three actors today.

107
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,600
So let's rehearse

108
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:17,399
the duel scene between Yan Chixia and Grandma first.

109
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,000
Xiaoqi.

110
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:19,240
Sorry.

111
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,880
Should I call you Director now?

112
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,120
No,

113
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:23,780
Mr. Heying.

114
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:26,960
I'm just temporarily taking over the director's job.

115
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:27,560
Okay,

116
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,720
Director.

117
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,920
Here's the thing.

118
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,080
As an actor,

119
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,560
I have some ideas of my own.

120
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,840
Actually, after rehearsing for these past few days,

121
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:37,960
I think everyone is already very familiar

122
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,040
with their own roles.

123
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,960
So I suggest

124
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,370
we try rehearsing the roles of Group B.

125
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,680
For instance, me.

126
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,720
I have a lot of my own ideas

127
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,440
about the role of Ning Caichen.

128
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:49,560
But we don't have Xiaoqian.

129
00:04:50,159 --> 00:04:50,760
Director.

130
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,680
I volunteer.

131
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,840
I can play her.

132
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:53,600
Actually,

133
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,800
I majored in musical theater.

134
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,480
Director.

135
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:59,720
Actually, I think I have the talent to play Nie Xiaoqian too.

136
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,960
Baby, you play Nie Xiaoqian.

137
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,440
I'll play Ning Caichen.

138
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:04,320
Okay, I'll play Ning Caichen.

139
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,200
If you play Ning Caichen,

140
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,460
what am I going to play?

141
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:07,800
Director,

142
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,680
actually, I've been practicing Yan Chixia's sword dance

143
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,040
for a long time too.

144
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,560
Director.

145
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,320
I...

146
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,560
I want to act.

147
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,240
Director.

148
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:17,720
Let me tell you.

149
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,360
Alright.

150
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,560
Everyone, please calm down.

151
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,240
Everyone.

152
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,880
Everyone has the opportunity to play the role they want.

153
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:25,200
So let's rehearse Insect Chirps first.

154
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,260
Come on, everyone.

155
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:27,210
Let's rehearse.

156
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:32,320
I will play Nie Xiaoqian.

157
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:32,800
Director,

158
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,280
please assign a role to me.

159
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,800
Hello, Feixin.

160
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,360
Hello.

161
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,320
We all know that

162
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,720
you are a very successful musical actress.

163
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,200
So, in terms of film and television,

164
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:42,400
do you have any intentions to get involved?

165
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:43,159
Indeed, I have

166
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:45,400
received some casting offers for film and TV dramas before.

167
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:47,720
But after all, I am a musical actress.

168
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,200
I think

169
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:50,600
I still need to take root in the field I love.

170
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,560
After all, besides acting,

171
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,420
vocal music is my strongest suit.

172
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,720
Next, I can perform for everyone

173
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:00,080
a segment from our musical Nie Xiaoqian.

174
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,720
Actually.

175
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:05,880
You don't understand.

176
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:09,880
It's a wonderful impulse.

177
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,200
We

178
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:13,960
look so hollow.

179
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:17,160
Thoughts are surging again.

180
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:19,480
Pupils empty.

181
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:22,200
Well, due to time constraints, we...

182
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,160
You don't understand.

183
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:29,160
It's a wonderful impulse.

184
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,000
Feixin, we...

185
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,920
Look so hollow.

186
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:36,440
Thoughts are surging again.

187
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:38,800
Pupils empty.

188
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:43,840
Piercing through thick memories.

189
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:47,480
Sufan, your boom pole moved.

190
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,920
It's not Luo Li.

191
00:06:52,159 --> 00:06:53,620
You must be seeing things.

192
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:57,060
I just wanted to tease you because you were falling asleep.

193
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:01,080
Does anyone have any unforgettable fishing experiences

194
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,340
that you want to share?

195
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,600
I do.

196
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,560
Luo Li.

197
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:07,320
When I was little, my dad used to take me fishing a lot.

198
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:10,240
But I didn't have much patience back then.

199
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:12,720
Let's go over the whole process first.

200
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:14,160
The first item is fishing.

201
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,240
The second item is cooking.

202
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,640
The third item is eating.

203
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:18,720
The fourth item is traditional culture experience.

204
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,600
The fifth item is

205
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,160
planting trees.

206
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:23,880
The last item is Jin Xi's personal talent show.

207
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:27,120
Cooking and the talent show go without saying.

208
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,800
It's definitely Jin Xi's personal part.

209
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,560
So which part do you think

210
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,200
will be the most helpful

211
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,460
for you to promote A Chinese Ghost Story?

212
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:34,170
Fishing.

213
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,010
Exactly.

214
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:36,640
Why?

215
00:07:37,159 --> 00:07:38,480
The show invited Jin Xi

216
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:40,040
because of the controversy around him.

217
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,159
The later the segments are,

218
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:43,640
the more they will focus on his dark history and personal growth.

219
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:46,680
So it's highly unlikely you'll get to promote it.

220
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,480
Only during the fishing segment

221
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,640
can you talk about A Chinese Ghost Story.

222
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:52,000
Thinking back now,

223
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,040
I'll never forget for the rest of my life

224
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:55,040
the happiness my dad felt when he caught a fish.

225
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,570
Thanks for sharing, Luo Li.

226
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:58,700
Director Ning.

227
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:01,970
Do you have any unforgettable fishing experiences?

228
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:04,260
You can share them with everyone.

229
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,840
It's fine, go ahead.

230
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:10,240
Go on.

231
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,520
Our new show is called 'Qian Nv You Hun',

232
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,040
adapted from 'Liaozhai'.

233
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:18,080
I believe everyone is familiar with this story.

234
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:20,400
Ning Caichen is played by Jin Xi.

235
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,660
Nie Xiaoqian is played by Bai Feixin.

236
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,800
Thanks for sharing, Director Ning.

237
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:27,930
Do you like fishing?

238
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:31,360
Me?

239
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:35,640
I remember the last time we did a life-sharing session at the troupe,

240
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,880
I told the director about it.

241
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,809
Director, why don't you tell them?

242
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,960
Our Ning Caichen role has an A and B cast.

243
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,240
The other Ning Caichen

244
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,720
is played by the senior musical actor,

245
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,080
Mr. Du Heying.

246
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:46,800
Besides Du Heying,

247
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,000
Jin Xi and Bai Feixin,

248
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,200
our troupe also has Zhang Wanru,

249
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,280
Meng Tejiao and Qing Song.

250
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:52,840
Qing Song also serves as our dance choreographer.

251
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,600
Thank you so much for sharing, Director.

252
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:57,240
We can all feel your passion for theater.

253
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:58,660
Feixin,

254
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:02,040
do you have anything you want to share about fishing?

255
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:02,840
Regarding fishing,

256
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:04,560
I have prepared so much to say.

257
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,850
Director, do you have anything to say?

258
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,880
Our theater company was founded in 2010.

259
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:13,200
In particular,

260
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:15,800
2017 was an important turning point for our company.

261
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:16,560
In that year,

262
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,400
our original musical

263
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,280
'She, He and It'

264
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,960
won the National Excellent Musical Award.

265
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:20,290
Stop.

266
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:21,240
Director.

267
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,170
Mr. Liu Ding.

268
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,600
Why hasn't any fish taken the bait here yet?

269
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,640
Sorry, sir.

270
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,560
We've put a lot of fish in there already.

271
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,720
Maybe wait a little longer?

272
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,480
No, I can't wait.

273
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,320
Let's move on to the next segment.

274
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,080
Okay, no problem.

275
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,360
Is it ready yet?

276
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,560
Everyone, take a break first.

277
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,440
We will enter the next segment shortly.

278
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:34,970
Alright.

279
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,760
Where were the fish just now?

280
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:38,960
Don't talk nonsense next time.

281
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,040
What's wrong with teasing you?

282
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,400
All right. Hurry up.

283
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,660
Come on, turn it on.

284
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:44,880
I caught one!

285
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,940
Really? Let me see.

286
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:47,730
You are awesome!

287
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:49,760
It's so big.

288
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:50,490
Luoli, look.

289
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,640
Such a big fish!

290
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:53,370
Luoli, you are really amazing.

291
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,000
Hello.

292
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:00,600
Director.

293
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,200
Xiaoqi.

294
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,410
How is the rehearsal going?

295
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,490
Is it going well?

296
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:05,040
I...

297
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:05,880
We...

298
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,400
What on earth are you doing?

299
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:09,800
The old lady is like this.

300
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,200
I'll kill you!

301
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,840
Come on!

302
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,960
I am.

303
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,560
It's going quite well.

304
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:19,490
Okay, call me if you need anything.

305
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:23,040
I am Nie Xiaoqian.

306
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,480
His waist...

307
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,040
Look at you.

308
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,000
That hand...

309
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,280
Hand.

310
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,000
What should we do?

311
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,860
Director Ning.

312
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:34,820
Director Ning,

313
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,280
just look at me.

314
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,280
You don't need to look at the camera.

315
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:39,240
Look at me.

316
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,920
You can start your self-introduction.

317
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,980
Our Xiyin Troupe was founded in 2010.

318
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:43,280
Currently...

319
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:43,680
Currently, we've...

320
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:45,560
We have performed eight musicals,

321
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,920
five of which are ancient-style musicals.

322
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:47,560
Director Ning,

323
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,400
relax.

324
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,600
You're not giving a presentation.

325
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:52,160
Is this your first time participating in a variety show like this?

326
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:54,760
Our Xiyin Troupe currently has six principal actors,

327
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:56,920
including Jin Xi, Bai Feixin, Du Heying,

328
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,240
Zhang Wanru, Meng Tejiao, and Qingsong.

329
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,920
Director Ning,

330
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,000
please relax.

331
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,280
Just relax a little.

332
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,440
One, two, three, is that okay?

333
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:05,800
It's a bit low.

334
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:06,400
Director.

335
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,320
Can you stop bouncing out every time?

336
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:10,520
What's up?

337
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:11,800
Director,

338
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,440
relax.

339
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,040
Don't be nervous.

340
00:11:15,040 --> 00:11:15,970
It's no big deal.

341
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,050
Take it easy.

342
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,090
Am I nervous?

343
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,500
You look more nervous than me.

344
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,000
It's quite interesting.

345
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,260
Just say what you want.

346
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,160
Here,

347
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:30,080
I'll teach you a way to relieve nervousness.

348
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:30,600
That is,

349
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,100
when you feel nervous,

350
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:36,880
just imagine them all naked.

351
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:39,170
What are you talking about?

352
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:41,720
A senior taught me this on a variety show before.

353
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:44,160
He said when you're in an unfamiliar environment

354
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,440
and there's someone making you nervous,

355
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,240
just imagine them naked.

356
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:50,500
It closes the distance between you and them.

357
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,720
Nonsense.

358
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,920
Try it, Director.

359
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,980
It's quite useful.

360
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,290
Chicken powder.

361
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:02,680
Bro, let me tell you,

362
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:03,600
as long as you don't add these.

363
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,720
Add sugar at the end, right?

364
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,680
This is salt.

365
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:06,410
Is this salt?

366
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,880
Bro, please don't be nervous.

367
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:10,120
As long as you remember the right order,

368
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:10,920
there will be no problem.

369
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:11,280
I'll just add a little...

370
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:12,360
It won't taste that bad.

371
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,020
Don't worry. Leave this to me.

372
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:15,600
Eason, you can go.

373
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:18,210
Don't be nervous. Just do as I said.

374
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:18,920
It's fine.

375
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,440
I'll do it first.

376
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,240
I'll put the salt.

377
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,640
You can't put this first.

378
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:23,680
Put it first.

379
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:25,010
Don't we put salt first?

380
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,170
I'll just get the knife.

381
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,240
That's not how you cut it.

382
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:36,080
Look, did I beat the eggs well?

383
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:40,120
Yes.

384
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:44,490
It's delicious.

385
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:46,000
Not bad.

386
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,560
It seems everyone cooks reasonably well.

387
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:51,480
Let's welcome today's special guest,

388
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,760
Mr. Li Xingliang.

389
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,720
Thank you, Mr. Liuding, for inviting me again

390
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:56,720
to 'Unexpected Life.'

391
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,200
A song called 'Must Like You Every Day',

392
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,330
hope you all like it.

393
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,080
Thank you.

394
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:55,040
Thank you, Mr. Li Xingliang, for the song.

395
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:56,000
Thank you.

396
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,440
Are you done?

397
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:00,720
Go down quickly if you are.

398
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:01,240
Talk less later.

399
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,440
Thank you for your hard work, guests.

400
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:02,970
Alright.

401
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:05,800
Before our special guests arrive,

402
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:07,560
I have a question for you all.

403
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:09,560
Have you seen 'The Legend of Huayue'?

404
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:09,880
Yes.

405
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:11,800
What do you think of it?

406
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:14,280
I think some romantic scenes in it

407
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,240
are quite sweet.

408
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:17,320
Did the director watch 'The Legend of Huayue'

409
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:19,250
and then choose to work with Jin Xi?

410
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:19,840
No.

411
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:22,240
It was because when he came to audition,

412
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,900
I felt he had great potential.

413
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,680
Are you saying

414
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,440
the director of 'The Legend of Huayue'

415
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:29,500
didn't discover Jin Xi's potential?

416
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:33,880
I haven't seen the full version of 'The Legend of Huayue',

417
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,080
so it's hard to judge.

418
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:37,880
Jin Xi,

419
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:40,800
if there's another opportunity like this,

420
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:41,920
would you still choose

421
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:44,780
to work with the director of 'The Legend of Huayue'?

422
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:47,720
That's unlikely.

423
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,440
The director has already blocked me.

424
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,160
Really?

425
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:51,560
Why?

426
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,920
You'll have to ask the director.

427
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:54,440
Okay.

428
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:57,960
Let's welcome our special guests,

429
00:15:57,960 --> 00:16:00,200
director of 'The Legend of Huayue', Charlie Wang,

430
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:02,800
as well as his leading actor and actress, Li Ye,

431
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:04,000
and Lv Lili.

432
00:16:04,280 --> 00:16:05,040
Welcome.

433
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,130
Long time no see,

434
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,040
Mr. Jin Xi.

435
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:24,420
Stop the music.

436
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:27,300
Everyone, I think it should be like this.

437
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:29,560
For Ning Caichen's backpack,

438
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:31,880
I think he can totally carry it himself.

439
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:32,960
Only in this way

440
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:35,920
can we show his humble and respectful nature.

441
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:36,720
Let's do it again.

442
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,120
Um,

443
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:37,920
Um, Mr. He...

444
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:38,400
Music.

445
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:39,360
Mr. Heying,

446
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:41,440
if you make this change,

447
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:43,080
the director won't agree to it.

448
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:43,560
Xiaoqi.

449
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:46,080
Art is more about communication.

450
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,480
We just need this kind of collision

451
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,240
to spark more inspiration.

452
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,240
Come on, everyone.

453
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,120
Let's do it one more time.

454
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:51,960
Thanks for your hard work.

455
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:52,420
This...

456
00:16:53,160 --> 00:16:54,160
Don't mess around with him.

457
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:54,760
I...

458
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:13,119
Stop the music.

459
00:17:13,119 --> 00:17:13,650
How is it,

460
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:14,680
how is it?

461
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,240
Everyone,

462
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:17,599
Doesn't this character instantly become fleshed out?

463
00:17:17,599 --> 00:17:18,000
Right?

464
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:19,500
What do you think, Xiaoqi?

465
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,599
Mr. Qingsong,

466
00:17:23,079 --> 00:17:23,920
don't ask me.

467
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:25,720
I'm only in charge of the dance part.

468
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:26,839
We'll talk about the dance later.

469
00:17:26,839 --> 00:17:27,119
Come on,

470
00:17:27,119 --> 00:17:28,119
let's do it again.

471
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:47,120
Pause.

472
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,000
Stop the music.

473
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:49,680
Laolao,

474
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:51,600
why are you on stage?

475
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,800
I'm standing in for Nie Xiaoqian.

476
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:57,080
But Nie Xiaoqian shouldn't appear in this scene.

477
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:59,800
Well, I actually have my own ideas.

478
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:03,840
Why can't it be that when Ning Caichen first appears,

479
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:05,840
I have a perfect encounter with him?

480
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:07,040
Baby,

481
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:09,200
that's a great idea.

482
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:13,320
But Nie Xiaoqian is a female ghost.

483
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:14,680
How could she come out during the day?

484
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:16,560
I can transform into a human.

485
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:18,290
There are many possibilities.

486
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:21,920
I can be an alluring brothel woman,

487
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:24,000
or a mighty female general.

488
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:26,040
The female general idea is good.

489
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:28,560
It can also show Ning Caichen's patriotism.

490
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:30,000
Exactly. I'll go find a sword.

491
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:30,720
I'll go get a sword, too.

492
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,380
I'll go too.

493
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:14,330
You look pretty good in this scene.

494
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:22,600
Why can they promote it so openly?

495
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:26,600
Because 'Huayue Zhuan II'

496
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:28,000
and 'Unexpected Life'

497
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,400
are on the same platform.

498
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:35,440
You see,

499
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:39,280
Ye's costume look is just better than mine.

500
00:19:39,280 --> 00:19:39,960
Bring it on.

501
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:41,920
But I feel like he has the same expression for everything.

502
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:42,850
It's very weird.

503
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:47,160
I finally know

504
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:49,480
why he never makes big expressions when acting.

505
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:50,800
These special effects are pretty good.

506
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:51,320
Not bad.

507
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:53,640
They knew his expressions were weird,

508
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:55,200
yet deliberately magnified his flaws.

509
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:55,760
Exactly.

510
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:03,200
Great.

511
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,040
That was fantastic.

512
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:07,560
Thank you.

513
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,340
Today, we thank the director,

514
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:13,200
Lili,

515
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:13,840
and

516
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:14,640
Yeye

517
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:16,840
for bringing us 'Huayue Zhuan 2'.

518
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:17,880
Also, thank you

519
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,840
for coming as our guest stars.

520
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:20,800
You're too kind.

521
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:21,330
Liu Ding,

522
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:23,480
didn't I hear you guys are planting trees today?

523
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:25,400
One generation plants the trees, another gets the shade.

524
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:27,860
I think this is a very meaningful thing to do.

525
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:29,090
I just didn't expect

526
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,960
to run into Mr. Jinxi here today.

527
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,490
This is destiny, director.

528
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:35,810
Destiny.

529
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:36,480
All right.

530
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:39,760
Our tree-planting team is setting off now.

531
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:41,120
Let's go.

532
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:43,680
Jinzi,

533
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:45,600
we only have each other now.

534
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:46,640
That bastard.

535
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,000
I'm sorry.

536
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:07,960
I was wrong.

537
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:09,560
I don't want to hear it.

538
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:10,440
Just let me say one thing.

539
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:11,000
Please listen.

540
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:11,680
I beg you.

541
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:14,120
Okay.

542
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:17,010
Tell me what exactly you did wrong.

543
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:18,730
I shouldn't have been late.

544
00:21:19,320 --> 00:21:20,400
Not that.

545
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:25,000
I shouldn't have been late

546
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,800
and not apologized to you immediately.

547
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:27,730
Not that either.

548
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:30,280
Then why?

549
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:33,680
Because you bought me a gift.

550
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:34,560
I...

551
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:35,560
I...

552
00:21:35,560 --> 00:21:37,760
Is buying you a gift a heinous crime?

553
00:21:38,560 --> 00:21:39,960
What did you tell me then?

554
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:41,240
You said you were late on the 7th

555
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:43,200
because you were buying a gift.

556
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:43,440
Right?

557
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:43,840
Right.

558
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:46,000
But the receipt for that gift

559
00:21:46,120 --> 00:21:47,280
is dated the 8th.

560
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:50,000
And then on the 9th, you brought the gift to apologize to me.

561
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,880
But I wanted to use the gift to make up for our relationship.

562
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:52,800
I know I was wrong.

563
00:21:52,800 --> 00:21:53,680
Is it wrong to make amends?

564
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:55,010
But you were lying to me.

565
00:21:55,400 --> 00:21:57,920
You were using one lie to cover up another.

566
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,400
What is real about you?

567
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,320
I feel like

568
00:22:00,840 --> 00:22:02,800
I'm surrounded by lies.

569
00:22:02,800 --> 00:22:04,060
My love for you is real.

570
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:09,960
Then why did you lie to me?

571
00:22:12,560 --> 00:22:13,080
I admit

572
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:15,020
I lied to you this time.

573
00:22:15,120 --> 00:22:16,560
But you can tell every time I lie.

574
00:22:16,560 --> 00:22:16,960
Right?

575
00:22:17,560 --> 00:22:18,680
Now I'm standing here

576
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:19,940
realizing my mistake.

577
00:22:20,040 --> 00:22:21,300
Do you think it's real?

578
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:23,120
I'm sincerely apologizing to you.

579
00:22:23,120 --> 00:22:24,380
Do you think it's real?

580
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:26,720
I really love you.

581
00:22:27,280 --> 00:22:28,540
Do you think it's real?

582
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:33,620
I was wrong.

583
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:41,000
This is the last time.

584
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:43,520
I'm sorry.

585
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:46,320
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

586
00:22:47,800 --> 00:22:49,060
I shouldn't have lied.

587
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:53,400
Actually, I wasn't so great either.

588
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:55,040
Let's stop fighting.

589
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:56,840
Let's never fight again, okay?

590
00:22:58,160 --> 00:22:59,960
Whoever fights again is a puppy.

591
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,040
Is a puppy.

592
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:04,040
All right.

593
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:06,800
I was just feeding Jinzi.

594
00:23:07,320 --> 00:23:08,720
We're done feeding.

595
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:10,800
Let's watch that movie from before again.

596
00:23:10,800 --> 00:23:11,280
Okay?

597
00:23:11,800 --> 00:23:12,400
Awesome.

598
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:13,730
Let's go.

599
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:20,560
Jinzi!

600
00:23:23,840 --> 00:23:24,320
Jinzi!

601
00:23:24,760 --> 00:23:25,760
Hello, Director Zha.

602
00:23:25,760 --> 00:23:26,280
Hello.

603
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:28,240
I'd like to interview you.

604
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:30,720
Did you know that by participating in this show,

605
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,120
you would run into Jin Xi?

606
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:32,640
To be honest,

607
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:33,440
before I came,

608
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:36,180
I really didn't expect to see Jin Xi here.

609
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:39,560
Of course, we haven't seen each other for a long time.

610
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:41,020
In 'The Legend of Huayue',

611
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:43,200
after experiencing such a huge setback,

612
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:43,920
Jin Xi

613
00:23:44,320 --> 00:23:47,440
still persisted in acting.

614
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:49,000
I think this courage

615
00:23:49,600 --> 00:23:51,840
is highly admirable.

616
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:52,480
Surprisingly,

617
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:54,140
setting aside his abilities,

618
00:23:55,120 --> 00:23:57,280
his courage is worth learning from.

619
00:23:58,040 --> 00:23:58,900
I'll hold this.

620
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:02,640
Is this okay?

621
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:03,600
Good luck.

622
00:24:03,600 --> 00:24:04,240
Director,

623
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:07,680
from 'The Legend of Huayue 1' to '2',

624
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:10,800
has it been a long time since you and Lili saw Jin Xi?

625
00:24:11,840 --> 00:24:14,680
Since 'The Legend of Huayue 1' aired,

626
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:16,140
we haven't seen him at all.

627
00:24:16,800 --> 00:24:17,400
Me too.

628
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:19,400
I thought I'd never see Jin Xi again.

629
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:21,920
Honestly,

630
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:23,880
when the crew told me you were coming,

631
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,340
I was quite surprised too.

632
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:27,240
Especially the director.

633
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:29,440
And I heard a funny rumor

634
00:24:29,440 --> 00:24:30,960
that you blocked Jin Xi.

635
00:24:32,840 --> 00:24:33,900
How should I put it?

636
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:35,540
Anyway, during that time,

637
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:37,080
when the project just launched,

638
00:24:37,080 --> 00:24:38,800
90% of the negative reviews

639
00:24:38,800 --> 00:24:40,360
were aimed at Jin Xi.

640
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:41,440
To be honest,

641
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:43,600
whenever I heard the name Jin Xi back then,

642
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:44,930
I got a stress reaction.

643
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:46,760
So,

644
00:24:47,120 --> 00:24:48,400
I really did block him.

645
00:24:51,360 --> 00:24:51,960
Jin Xi.

646
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:54,720
I was emotionally unstable.

647
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:55,520
It's my fault.

648
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:56,900
Don't take it to heart.

649
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:57,840
It's fine.

650
00:24:58,480 --> 00:25:00,200
Director, see what I told you?

651
00:25:00,760 --> 00:25:02,440
Jin Xi doesn't care about those bad reviews

652
00:25:02,440 --> 00:25:03,440
or being blocked.

653
00:25:03,600 --> 00:25:04,880
He doesn't care at all.

654
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:06,280
It doesn't matter to him.

655
00:25:06,560 --> 00:25:08,280
He really is quite open-minded.

656
00:25:08,280 --> 00:25:09,480
If it were me,

657
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:10,540
I couldn't do that.

658
00:25:10,800 --> 00:25:12,530
I should learn from him on that.

659
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:21,160
Jinzi, where are you? Please, Jinzi!

660
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,290
It's all your fault.

661
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:23,920
You stood at the door for so long.

662
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:24,960
Why didn't you come in?

663
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:27,000
Then you should have let me in earlier.

664
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:28,600
Why are you yelling at me?

665
00:25:28,600 --> 00:25:30,160
Aren't you yelling at me too?

666
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:31,120
Didn't we agree not to fight?

667
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:32,040
Whoever fights is a puppy?

668
00:25:32,040 --> 00:25:33,400
You're a puppy.

669
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,200
You are a puppy too.

670
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:34,640
You puppy.

671
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,000
You.

672
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,000
You puppy.

673
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:36,680
Alright.

674
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:37,480
Stop talking.

675
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:39,570
Let's find Jinzi first.

676
00:25:40,560 --> 00:25:41,890
Fine, let's find Jinzi.

677
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:43,800
Jinzi!

678
00:25:45,080 --> 00:25:46,640
Jinzi!

679
00:25:49,280 --> 00:25:50,080
Clean up.

680
00:25:50,360 --> 00:25:51,200
Is this okay, director?

681
00:25:51,200 --> 00:25:52,130
Super handsome.

682
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:56,520
Director Zha.

683
00:25:57,080 --> 00:25:58,560
Okay, give us some space. Go on.

684
00:25:58,560 --> 00:25:59,490
Okay. What's up?

685
00:26:00,080 --> 00:26:01,560
I want to ask you a question.

686
00:26:01,560 --> 00:26:02,420
What question?

687
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:03,280
Well,

688
00:26:04,280 --> 00:26:06,280
do you really think my acting is terrible

689
00:26:06,280 --> 00:26:07,960
and dragged down 'Huayue Legend'?

690
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:08,320
Yes.

691
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:14,200
Just kidding.

692
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:14,600
Come,

693
00:26:15,920 --> 00:26:16,400
sit down.

694
00:26:16,400 --> 00:26:17,000
Thank you.

695
00:26:21,320 --> 00:26:22,120
Director Zha,

696
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:24,760
I remember when we were filming on set,

697
00:26:25,080 --> 00:26:26,560
I came to discuss the character with you.

698
00:26:26,560 --> 00:26:28,120
Didn't you tell me it was fine,

699
00:26:28,120 --> 00:26:29,120
not to overthink,

700
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:30,480
and that I was hardworking?

701
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:30,920
Yes.

702
00:26:31,560 --> 00:26:32,040
Jin Xi,

703
00:26:32,760 --> 00:26:33,690
you have to know.

704
00:26:34,080 --> 00:26:35,000
For an actor, it's

705
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:37,400
99% hard work

706
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,440
and 1% talent.

707
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:40,960
You've already done

708
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:42,440
the 99%.

709
00:26:42,440 --> 00:26:43,570
You know what I mean?

710
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:48,040
Are you saying I have no talent?

711
00:26:49,560 --> 00:26:50,960
Think whatever you want.

712
00:26:53,360 --> 00:26:54,000
Anyway,

713
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:56,330
earlier was indeed for the show's effect.

714
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,640
But in the upcoming recordings,

715
00:26:58,640 --> 00:27:01,000
I hope we can agree

716
00:27:01,320 --> 00:27:04,040
to be harmonious

717
00:27:04,320 --> 00:27:06,680
and just enjoy this variety show, okay?

718
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:11,760
Hey,

719
00:27:12,320 --> 00:27:13,720
help me touch up my makeup.

720
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:14,250
Hurry up.

721
00:27:18,560 --> 00:27:22,440
I've searched upstairs and downstairs three times and still can't find him.

722
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:24,840
Do you think Jinzi went outside the neighborhood?

723
00:27:24,840 --> 00:27:25,640
Two years ago,

724
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:27,880
Jinzi was a dying kitten.

725
00:27:28,280 --> 00:27:29,440
Ning Jin saved him.

726
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:31,400
After Ning Jin saved him,

727
00:27:31,560 --> 00:27:34,620
the pet hospital said he would definitely be crippled.

728
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:37,480
But under Ning Jin's meticulous care,

729
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:39,120
he miraculously

730
00:27:39,360 --> 00:27:41,360
grew up with all four limbs healthy.

731
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:45,500
Ning Jin treats Jinzi better than her own daughter.

732
00:27:45,560 --> 00:27:46,880
If we can't find him,

733
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:51,000
she'll kill me.

734
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:52,160
Don't be afraid.

735
00:27:52,160 --> 00:27:53,600
I found someone specializing in finding cats.

736
00:27:53,600 --> 00:27:54,660
He'll be here soon.

737
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:57,000
He's here.

738
00:27:57,120 --> 00:27:57,650
Let's go.

739
00:28:03,920 --> 00:28:04,440
Hello.

740
00:28:06,160 --> 00:28:07,200
Who lost a cat?

741
00:28:08,560 --> 00:28:10,040
Is there anyone else here?

742
00:28:14,360 --> 00:28:15,640
Cat Detective David,

743
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:16,850
taking the case.

744
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:17,960
Wait,

745
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,020
slippers are here.

746
00:28:19,040 --> 00:28:19,840
No need.

747
00:28:22,320 --> 00:28:23,050
I have my own.

748
00:28:23,600 --> 00:28:24,730
I'm a professional.

749
00:28:32,360 --> 00:28:34,120
I've received the cat's info,

750
00:28:34,560 --> 00:28:38,120
but I still need to confirm its name, breed, and features,

751
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:43,400
as well as the time and place it was last seen.

752
00:28:44,720 --> 00:28:45,450
Chinchilla.

753
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:47,120
Name is Jinzi,

754
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,840
long gray-white hair.

755
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:51,720
The last time he was seen

756
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:54,280
was around 10 PM last night.

757
00:28:54,280 --> 00:28:55,810
The location is right here.

758
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:58,250
His scent is still here.

759
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:01,240
It must have slipped out through the window.

760
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:02,500
This is the 26th floor.

761
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:06,480
No.

762
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:11,720
I'm sure it is.

763
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,930
You don't need to tell me that much.

764
00:29:14,560 --> 00:29:15,420
The cat's scent

765
00:29:16,360 --> 00:29:17,840
will tell me everything.

766
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:24,220
I did it on purpose.

767
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:42,080
Is he reliable?

768
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:08,040
Understood.

769
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:10,240
It must have slipped out through the door,

770
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:12,920
not the window.

771
00:30:13,120 --> 00:30:14,080
Isn't it the door?

772
00:30:14,080 --> 00:30:14,720
Excuse me.

773
00:30:15,960 --> 00:30:17,480
This is how I work.

774
00:30:18,280 --> 00:30:19,680
Without investigation,

775
00:30:19,800 --> 00:30:20,860
there is no result.

776
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:32,490
Let's go.

777
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:33,440
Baby.

778
00:30:34,480 --> 00:30:35,440
I don't think he's reliable.

779
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:36,360
Let's go together.
